id: protector
name: Protector
order: 2
optionOf: functional-purpose
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  If an Opponent hits one of your Allies with an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Intervene Maneuver without spending a Counter Action as long as you are within 8 Squares of that Ally. If you do, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  Protector [Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Opponent hits one of your Allies with an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Intervene Maneuver without spending a Counter Action as long as you are within 8 Squares of that Ally. If you do, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# Asked as you Intervene for an Ally hit, within 8 Squares of them, once a Round: no Counter Action, and 2(T) more Damage
# Reduction against that attack (chat.mjs playIntervene, interventionOutcome).
[passive]
allow protector.intervene;
